        "name": "places/ChIJtT6aRtJYATQRp_b7x0Ai0LI/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOd2NYbE1NMjk1YUhOMWNrbzBZbmt6ZDA5dVlVRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "鹽焗走地雞，手打墨魚餅，豆豉蒸本地捕獲兩斤幾黃立䱽，苦瓜炆黃立䱽，大澳煎鹹魚，大澳銀魚仔蝦乾魷魚仔蒸飯，小炒王，👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻 大澳的隱世高手。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "鹽焗走地雞，手打墨魚餅，豆豉蒸本地捕獲兩斤幾黃立䱽，苦瓜炆黃立䱽，大澳煎鹹魚，大澳銀魚仔蝦乾魷魚仔蒸飯，小炒王，👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻 大澳的隱世高手。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Daisy Lai",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101408992864220657089/reviews",
